            "review_title": "Review at Kiwooza Planet D7",
            "review_text": "Seonguk Kang\n3 contributions\n0\nNice staffs, space and service\nNov 2023 • Family\nIt was a great for my kids.\nIn there, there were so many staffs who always care for my son and daughter.\nThey are really nice and kind. They always play with a lot of children enthusiamly\nAnd also, nice menu of food and beverage made me happy. I have never been this mood nowhere in Hochiminh City. It was like paradise for kids and parents. It was a little bit expensive, but I think it’s enough to nice experience\nI want to re-visit whenever, I recommend here to anybody.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 25, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
