            "review_text": "Stephanie C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam98 contributions\n0\nNice playground but terrible business\nFeb 2021 • Family\nI liked the play ground but I will never visit this venue again. They are so inconsiderate of their neighbours and pay awful music that can be heard several streets away, night after night. I can't support such greed and selfishness\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 2, 2021\nKiwooza Planet\nHello Stephanie, Thank you for your kind comment and your interest in our playground. For the noise incident that you report, we just want to be clear that our playground is only operated in level 1 of the building. Our cafe only put on chill music with standard built in sound system as kids is playing along the side and we close at 9pm. On the rooftop and ground floor and in the garden of building there is venue for rent for party and music show with full scaled PA system and light. The noise you got is mostly when parties and show happened\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
